1
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:03,332
How is the patient feeling today?

2
00:00:03,332 --> 00:00:07,182
Well… last night my boyfriend and I—

3
00:00:07,998 --> 00:00:12,967
We, uh… did something, and he ended up
getting a small injury. This morning he bled a little.

4
00:00:13,159 --> 00:00:15,418
We're wondering if there's a doctor
who can check that area.

5
00:00:15,418 --> 00:00:19,021
Yes, we have one. Please have a seat
and wait here for a moment.

6
00:00:21,519 --> 00:00:22,755
Why did you say that?

7
00:00:22,755 --> 00:00:23,664
Sit down.

8
00:00:27,794 --> 00:00:30,030
What're you scared of?
The nurse isn't gonna eat you.

9
00:00:30,590 --> 00:00:34,013
Why did you tell her we were together?

10
00:00:34,013 --> 00:00:36,000
What else was I supposed to say?

11
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,433
That we're strangers who somehow
ended up like that?

12
00:00:38,433 --> 00:00:40,525
Wouldn't that sound even weirder?

13
00:00:42,462 --> 00:00:43,904
Okay, fair.

14
00:01:03,436 --> 00:01:04,547
Are there many?

15
00:01:06,228 --> 00:01:07,393
Many what?

16
00:01:07,393 --> 00:01:08,492
People you're talking to.

17
00:01:08,908 --> 00:01:10,876
Oh— a few, I guess. Why?

18
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:15,673
Nothing. Just… you're replying to everyone.
Doesn't your hand get tired?

19
00:01:15,929 --> 00:01:18,804
I'm not replying to everyone.
Just a couple.

20
00:01:18,804 --> 00:01:21,512
Then why are you making that face?

21
00:01:22,184 --> 00:01:26,933
Does your wound hurt…
or are you jealous?

22
00:01:28,310 --> 00:01:30,129
Definitely jealous.

23
00:01:31,058 --> 00:01:33,617
Don't flatter yourself.
We're not even a thing.

24
00:01:37,076 --> 00:01:38,468
Book, can I ask something?

25
00:01:39,332 --> 00:01:40,072
Ask what?

26
00:01:40,664 --> 00:01:42,372
You've never met up
with anyone else, right?

27
00:01:44,293 --> 00:01:50,086
You're worried about me?
That's kind of cute.
